<title>LATVIA: LATEKO BECOMES STOCK EXCHANGE SHAREHOLDER.</title>
<headline>LATEKO BECOMES STOCK EXCHANGE SHAREHOLDER.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial bank Lateko Banka on Thursday said it has become a shareholder of the Riga stock exchange and is waiting for a meeting of bourse shareholders to confirm its membership.</p>
<p>&quot;Lateko is now a shareholder of the stock exchange and we are waiting for confirmation of our membershp on March 27,&quot; Lateko's head of marketing and bank development Igor Sharshakov told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said that as soon as the membership is confirmed, the bank will become a primary dealer on the stock exchange.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
